Team Blue was in for a flavourful treat when Jacqui Tyson's team presented a succulent variety: freshly prepared chicken, black forest and leg ham. So, for those seeking an alternative from pork, you can try the chicken ham. Those who aspire to live on the leaner side of the life can try the Black Forest ham, charred to a smokey delight, while for many, the traditional tender leg ham is the way to go.
