"Pleasantly surprised at the taste and texture of the chicken. First time having it, so I didn't know what to expect; and, as one who is really tired of chicken, this is a pleasantly refreshing way to have it for Christmas. The Black Forest ham: just the name had me and I was in no way disappointed. A must try."
