"I liked the Black Forest ham. It had a nice taste. The leg ham was my absolute favourite, bursting with flavour at every bite. I did not like the chicken ham."
- K.B., female
"The leg ham was the best for me, followed by the Black Forest ham. The chicken ham was okay, I would have needed a bigger serving to sway my mind."
- R.S., male
